  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></math> rad/sec&nbsp;</p><p>phase difference between&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>e</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi></math>&nbsp;is given by&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>X</mi><mi>R</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>so&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>in case of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mi>L</mi></math>&nbsp;circuit&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>L</mi></math></p><p>And in case of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;circuit&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><strong>For option&nbsp;</strong><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo></math> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math> and</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10000</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math><br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></math><br /><strong>For option</strong>&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo></math> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math> and</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0.1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></math><br /><strong>For option&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math> and</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math><br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></math><br /><strong>For option</strong><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math> and</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math><br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></math></p>"
  }
